{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:846536ebfe7db30d","name":"Nyriaan Spice","source":{"id":"source:reference-846536ebfe7db30d","title":"Nyriaan Spice","revision":21219,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:22:56Z","sha256":"7a5451634677edef741803bad58432bd88fe8b8bd64e82acefe29031c61d5b15","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21219","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nyriaan%20Spice&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-846536ebfe7db30d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the most recent contributions of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nyriaan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nyriaan","referenceId":"reference:ffb4373927de3433"}," to the fringe is known as Nyriaan Spice. It begins as a low-lying fungal weed called mire nettle. When properly processed, mire nettle is transformed into a powerful narcotic stimulant that enhances awareness and provides an unparalleled euphoric experience. Natives of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nyriaan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nyriaan","referenceId":"reference:ffb4373927de3433"}," have long used mire nettle as a mild intoxicant. Pharmaceutical interests in the medicinal potential of the fungal weed ultimately lead to distilling the active ingredients into a powerful form of spice. Although it has yet to make much of an impact on the galactic drug trade, Nyriaan Spice is gaining a momentum as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}," experiment with it in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Inner Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Inner_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When imbibed, Nyriaan Spice provides an instant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", moving the user +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and granting a +5 bonus to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," for 1 hour. In addition to the usual effect, characters with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat who are exposed to Nyriaan Spice gain a +5 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made in conjunction with the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power. When the effect of Nyriaan Spice wears off, users lapse into near catatonia, resulting in a -5 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," for 4 hours.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
